id: arrogant-unstoppable-mark
name: Arrogant and Unstoppable
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Arrogant and Unstoppable (2)'s, till the start of your next turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Villainous Trait
description: >
  Arrogant and Unstoppable (2): in the Healthy Health Threshold for all of your effects until the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Arrogant and Unstoppable (2): You may treat yourself as if you are in the Healthy Health Threshold for all of your effects until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive]
allow threshold.asHealthy;
